stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> pending: online order created
  [*] --> cod: cash on delivery order
  pending --> paid: webhook says succeeded
  pending --> failed: webhook says failed
  failed --> pending: customer retries
  pending --> expired: unpaid for 15 minutes
  failed --> expired: unpaid for 15 minutes
  pending --> void: customer cancels
  failed --> void: customer cancels
  paid --> refunded: order cancelled
  expired --> [*]
  void --> [*]
  refunded --> [*]
